  <div class="container">
    <h2>About Guess the Score</h2>
    <p>Guess the Score is a <strong>free football score-prediction game</strong> for friends and communities. Create a league, share the invite code, predict match scores, and compete on the league rankings.</p>

    <h3>No real money</h3>
    <p>This is a game of skill and fun for entertainment only. <strong>No real-money betting takes place.</strong> There is no wagering, prizes, or payout of any kind.</p>

    <h3>How it works</h3>
    <p>League owners add matches and set final results. Players predict the score before kickoff. Exact scores earn the most points, correct outcomes earn half, and players are ranked by total points within their league.</p>

    <h3>Contact</h3>
    <p>For questions or feedback, please reach out via the league admin or the contact form provided by your site host.</p>
